hamcall-db — NOTICE
===================

This project (hamcall-db) builds a single, normalized amateur-radio callsign
dataset by aggregating data from several upstream sources, each published under
its own license. This NOTICE lists every upstream source, its license, and the
attribution it requires.

Two licenses are in play and they cover different things:

  * BUILD CODE — the Python build pipeline in this repository — is licensed
    under the MIT License.

  * PUBLISHED DATASET — the Parquet artifacts released from this project
    (hamcall-db-YYYY-MM-DD.parquet and hamcall-db-history-YYYY-MM-DD.parquet) —
    is a combined/derived work of the upstream sources below. It is distributed
    under the UNION of all upstream source terms. To redistribute the dataset
    you must satisfy every attribution-required license listed here
    simultaneously.


